        "verdict": "accurate",
        "reason": "The etymology and definition of redox reactions as reactions involving simultaneous oxidation and reduction are correct.",
        "errors": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "u2",
      "kind": "CONCEPT",
      "label": "Definition and identification criteria of oxidation",
      "excerpts": [
        {
          "text": "ऑक्सीकरण वह प्रक्रिया है जिसमें किसी पदार्थ से **इलेक्ट्रॉन निकलते हैं**।\n\nइसे इस प्रकार भी पहचान सकते हैं:\n\n- इलेक्ट्रॉन का **हानि** होना  \n- ऑक्सीजन का **जुड़ना**  \n- हाइड्रोजन का **हटना**  \n- ऑक्सीकरण संख्या (Oxidation Number) का **बढ़ना**",
          "occurrence": 0
        }
      ],
      "attributes": {
        "depth": "statement"
      },
      "contextualization": {
        "value": "none",
        "evidence": []
      },
      "accuracy": {
        "verdict": "accurate",
        "reason": "The definition of oxidation and all four identifying criteria (loss of electrons, addition of oxygen, removal of hydrogen, increase in oxidation number) are scientifically accurate.",
        "errors": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "u3",
      "kind": "EXAMPLE",
      "label": "Oxidation half-reaction of magnesium",
      "excerpts": [
        {
          "text": "### उदाहरण\n\\[\nMg \\rightarrow Mg^{2+} + 2e^-\n\\]\n\nयहाँ मैग्नीशियम (Mg) ने 2 इलेक्ट्रॉन खो दिए, इसलिए इसका **ऑक्सीकरण** हुआ।",
          "occurrence": 0
        }
      ],
      "attributes": {
        "context": "abstract_or_hypothetical",
        "treatment": "worked"
      },
      "contextualization": {
        "value": "none",
        "evidence": []
      },
      "accuracy": {
        "verdict": "accurate",
        "reason": "The half-equation showing the loss of two electrons by magnesium and its identification as oxidation are correct.",
        "errors": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "u4",
      "kind": "CONCEPT",
      "label": "Definition and identification criteria of reduction",
      "excerpts": [
        {
          "text": "अपचयन वह प्रक्रिया है जिसमें कोई पदार्थ **इलेक्ट्रॉन ग्रहण करता है**।\n\nइसे इस प्रकार पहचान सकते हैं:\n\n- इलेक्ट्रॉन का **लाभ** होना  \n- ऑक्सीजन का **हटना**  \n- हाइड्रोजन का **जुड़ना**  \n- ऑक्सीकरण संख्या का **घटना**",
          "occurrence": 0
        }
